abbas tere bin mujhe dushwaar hai jeena<br>
chadar jo chhini zainab e muztar ne pukara<br>
<br>
tum jiske muhafiz rahe aye shere dilawar <br>
ab qaid me abbas wahin hai teri khwahar <br>
tum raahiye jannat huwe mai hogayi tanha<br>
<br>
ujda hai bas ek roz me amma ka bhara ghar <br>
rassi me jakad kar mujhe lejate hai'n dar dar <br>
is haal me pursa nahi koi bhi hamara<br>
<br>
qaime jale asbaab luta lut gayi khwahar <br>
deti mai kafan tum ko jo hoti meri chadar <br>
jalti huwi reti pa hai maajaye ka lasha<br>
<br>
do aake tassali ke pareshaa'n hai sakina <br>
parde ka hamare koi samaa'n karo bhayya <br>
sab dekhte hai'n aye mere ghazi tera rasta<br>
<br>
bhayya jise har roz the seene se lagaate <br>
uspar hai sitam roz naya ahle jafa ke <br>
tum aake do masoom ko taskeen khudara<br>
<br>
haste hain shaqi ret pa pani ko baha ke <br>
masooma pe ye zulm hai in ahle jafa ke <br>
mazloomi pe in bachau ki phat-ta hai kaleja<br>
